{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786433224099,"sessionID":"ses_010495952ffeknG4pENad6KM6w","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_G3uTttnCan3zc2POinW3OciM","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"step_dispatch|step_post_dispatch|step_reduce|phase_synthesis|step_synthesize|synthesis_complete|status.*complete|stop_policy|target_agent|resolved_route|agent_definition_loaded","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml"},"output":"Found 100 matches (more matches available)\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-command-benchmark-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 59:   success_status: \"STATUS=OK when every requested instrument completed validly, regardless of subject outcome\"\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-model-benchmark-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 198:       step_reduce:\n\n  Line 215:         condition: \"gate_after_score == 'B' AND benchmark report recommendation == 'benchmark-pass' AND benchmark report status == 'benchmark-complete'\"\n\n  Line 219:   phase_synthesis:\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt:\n  Line 42:   stop_policy: convergence  # one of: convergence | max-iterations\n\n  Line 74: | `stop_policy` | Y | flag `--stop-policy=convergence|max-iterations`, marker `stop_policy`, or default | `convergence` | N |\n\n  Line 90: **Stop policy:** `stop_policy=convergence` preserves normal deep-review behavior: legal convergence may stop before `maxIterations`. `stop_policy=max-iterations` makes convergence signals telemetry-only until the iteration ceiling; before `maxIterations`, broaden the next angle instead of synthesizing. Terminal manual pause, user stop, unrecoverable error, and `maxIterationsReached` still stop.\n\n  Line 115:    |-- --stop-policy=convergence|max-iterations -> stop_policy = value\n\n  Line 137:    +-- Defaults: maxIterations=7, convergenceThreshold=0.10, antiConvergence.convergenceMode=`default`, antiConvergence.divergent=`{}`, stop_policy=`convergence`, lineage_mode=`auto`, config.executor.type=`native`, config.executor.timeoutSeconds=900, config.resource_map.emit=`true`\n\n  Line 218:    - stop_policy = [from flag, marker, or default convergence]\n\n  Line 233: - `spec_choice` | `spec_path` | `execution_mode` | `maxIterations` | `convergenceThreshold` | `convergence_mode` | `stop_policy`\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-command-benchmark-auto.yaml:\n  Line 60:   success_status: \"STATUS=OK when every requested instrument completed validly, regardless of subject outcome\"\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-agent-improvement-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 268:       step_reduce:\n\n  Line 292:   phase_synthesis:\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:\n  Line 157:       After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n\n  Line 159:       phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n\n  Line 245:           completed-session: \"Resume artifacts exist and config.status == 'complete'\"\n\n  Line 770:                 short_circuit: \"When status is completed or failed, skip all dispatch and record steps and bind this result as pi